B.F9=A.b(s(["Kaela... you can hear me? The UEC signal suppressors are finally weakening.","I am Gaia \u2014 this world's consciousness. What they call an anomaly is a memory. The Aetherians lived here long before humanity arrived.","Find their fragments scattered across Elysium. They hold the truth the UEC wants buried. The portal will take you deeper."]),t.s)
